ike \"Unterminated string: missing closing double quote\"\n- Evidence: All error messages are human-readable and actionable\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n**AC-003.4**: Error output is written to stderr\n- Status: VERIFIED\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:348-351` - uses `console.error()` for errors\n- Evidence: CLI integration test \"outputs errors to stderr with file:line:col format\" passes\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n### REQ-004: Exit Code Behavior\n\n**AC-004.1**: Exit code 0 when all files pass validation\n- Status: VERIFIED\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:397` - `process.exit(0)` when no errors\n- Evidence: Valid file validation exits with code 0\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n**AC-004.2**: Exit code 1 when one or more files fail validation\n- Status: VERIFIED\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:394-395` - `process.exit(1)` when `hasValidationErrors`\n- Evidence: Invalid YAML file exits with code 1\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n**AC-004.3**: Exit code 2 when command-line arguments are invalid or files cannot be read\n- Status: VERIFIED\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:374-376, 382-383, 392-393` - exit(2) for no files, no matches, or file errors\n- Evidence: Missing file exits with code 2, no files specified exits with code 2\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n### REQ-005: Glob Pattern Support\n\n**AC-005.1**: Given a glob pattern like \"config/*.yaml\", when validation is run, then all matching files are validated\n- Status: VERIFIED\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:220-231` - `resolveGlob()` uses `Bun.Glob` to expand patterns\n- Evidence: Running `bun run validate-yaml \"/tmp/glob_test/*.y*\"` validates both test1.yaml and test2.yml\n- Field Notes: N/A\n- Issues: None\n\n**AC-005.2**: Given a pattern matching no files, when validation is run, then appropriate message is displayed\n- Status: PARTIAL\n- Implementation: `src/yaml-validator.ts:380-383` - checks `resolvedFiles.leng